---
/**
 * One card of the "Upcoming Events & Webinars" rail on the event detail
 * template. Pasted into a Code Embed INSIDE the Collection Item of a hidden
 * Collection List (class `ct-event-related-source`), so it repeats per event.
 *
 * Replace each `[[ Field ]]` with "+ Add Field" → that field, exactly as in
 * Template.astro. The script in Template.astro moves every card into the
 * rail's <ul>, builds the link from `data-slug`, and skips the current event —
 * so this embed carries no script and no styles of its own. The icons are the
 * `ct-evd-*` sprite symbols that Template.astro defines on the same page.
 */
---

<li data-slug="[[ Slug ]]">
  <a href="#">
    <figure>
      <img src="[[ Thumbnail ]]" alt="[[ Name ]]" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" />
      <span>
        <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#ct-evd-globe"></use></svg>
        [[ Type ]]
      </span>
      <span>
        <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#ct-evd-arrow"></use></svg>
      </span>
      <span>[[ Speaker 1 Name ]], [[ Speaker 1 Role ]]</span>
    </figure>
    <h3>[[ Name ]]</h3>
    <p>
      <time>
        <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#ct-evd-calendar"></use></svg>
        [[ Date ]]
      </time>
      <span></span>
      <span>
        <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#ct-evd-clock"></use></svg>
        [[ Display Time ]]
      </span>
    </p>
  </a>
</li>
